le=\"text-align: start;\">4、電費與樓下平分，月付約1500～3500（依個人使用量）</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">5、本屋不包租代管，不賣房，謝謝</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">6、頂加，在五樓</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">7、簽約須有一位保證人一起公證，承租人須負擔公證費。</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。\r\n本房屋近板橋文化公車站、藍路、板橋捷運站、板橋火車站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "板橋區建國街", "lat": "25.0170249", "lng": "121.458505", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "subway", "name": "板橋站", "distance": 534, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約534公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "國光路站", "distance": 84, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約84公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "大庭新村(國光路)站", "distance": 168, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約168公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "湯姆熊遠東店", "distance": 903, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約903公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "古早麵店", "distance": 27, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約27公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "secondary", "name": "板橋高中生活科技創客教室", "distance": 466, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約466公尺"}, {"type": "primary", "name": "新北市板橋區板橋國小後門", "distance": 549, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約549公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "13,000元/月 (可申請租金補貼)", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "電費", "value": "平分賬單", "key": "electricFee"}, {"name": "管理費", "value": "無", "key": "manageprice"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "水費", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋未辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "住家用", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "